{"v":4,"catch":"投入Energi戰爭，展開你的奇幻RPG旅程！","desc":"在《Alphadia I》之前，世界因Energi戰爭而支離破碎——這場戰爭源於人類對生命能量的渴望。在這混亂之中，一名名為Alfonso的Energi複製人開始質疑一切。他憑藉著懷疑與堅定，踏上了尋找意義的旅程，在被權力吞噬的世界中探索真相。等待他的會是什麼樣的答案？\n\n《Alphadia III》隆重回歸，帶來深度回合制戰鬥、能扭轉戰局的SP技能，以及新系統如陣列與Energi Crock。升級你的飛船成為水上飛機，交換Energi元素，投入任務、競技場與更多內容——全部呈現在迷人的像素畫風與美麗的奇幻RPG冒險中。","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2026-11-19","genres":["角色扮演","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.1GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2a2de80e5aabac16e25e97282b495d834376e25933ca34c07e0aef1e493df9dd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bd15b54fa41239a75211470288344fbd1cdf7a228626957cfb97d769ee129acb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6ea1aea0410e5568df0e0a5051cba5495676c60ed7b102ce50ec49bb248f332f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d86cf74b38c8b8f5e9fdf1bef5f74d35eb1d42b6c8f840c4be2d76ab069a57aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ec7ffa8cd53a00cae6586e30e4b50c7e460824b1f03903a92524bd66677bcaa3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d9b05c8fa10dccb83a8371b0709da255b37d9faaa93826911afba2e6ac85c619.jpg"],"titleId":"010030f02465e000","dlc":[],"vids":["rC94FuaR6GI"]}